hed onto her by her stepfather. The only recourse I have is to leave the situation entirely as I don't really want to go to jail for beating this dude's ass or worse and she already is demanding I accept this or else. \n\nWell, I refuse to do so. So, I've revoked all the fancy little toys I've bought her over the years, dropped off a box of random things to their house, and will sign the paperwork next week. At first, it is a phase and you must walk on eggshells. Then, it becomes a transition and again, you must walk on eggshells. Finally, it becomes permanent and, while still walking on eggshells, every single thing that is perceived as going against their identity is a threat to them. It's over, boys. \n\nMany people discuss having children's mental health considered but also ignore a parent's mental health and demand they accept things that aren't remotely true or close to reality. So, I have decided to take my own mental health and life into my own hands and walk away from that entire situation and focus on my life with my current wife and having new children with her. \n\nIt's a shame but I felt the need to vent somewhere so here it is. Good luck out there. ", "author": "chefjeffb", "created": 1795097998376, "profile_picture": "2QfiB4s3Wg1o", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Protonboy", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Well, my child is gone. ", "last_comment_created": 1795127972011, "content": "<p>Context: had a daughter with a moderate leftist, she married a militant leftist about 6 months after the birth, now that militant leftist husband is shoveling trans down her throat and into her mind, daughter now screeches that I must accept this, and militant leftist husband doesn't work and posts things about Republicans (or anyone even slightly more moderate than he is, to be honest) being Nazis and the scourge of the Earth</p>\n<p>To be honest, my daughter is 16 and has decided to abandon her core identity and accept whatever nonsense is being legitimately pushed onto her by her stepfather. The only recourse I have is to leave the situation entirely as I don't really want to go to jail for beating this dude's ass or worse and she already is demanding I accept this or else.</p>\n<p>Well, I refuse to do so. So, I've revoked all the fancy little toys I've bought her over the years, dropped off a box of random things to their house, and will sign the paperwork next week. At first, it is a phase and you must walk on eggshells. Then, it becomes a transition and again, you must walk on eggshells. Finally, it becomes permanent and, while still walking on eggshells, every single thing that is perceived as going against their identity is a threat to them. It's over, boys.</p>\n<p>Many people discuss having children's mental health considered but also ignore a parent's mental health and demand they accept things that aren't remotely true or close to reality. So, I have decided to take my own mental health and life into my own hands and walk away from that entire situation and focus on my life with my current wife and having new children with her.</p>\n<p>It's a shame but I felt the need to vent somewhere so here it is. Good luck out there.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 78, "score_up": 243, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiOIxFr", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 163, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_